  layout: AppShell > PageLayout                            # SPINE
  sections:
    - feed / registry      -> bcn-tracking-shell           # the two halves as tabs (segmented, outer level)
        - the feed         -> bcn-tracking-feed            # four views (underline, inner level) + the two provenance alert boxes
